Test fixtures
-------------
The files in documents/ are copies of test fixtures of doclines 0.1.0
(https://github.com/st412m/doclines, test/fixtures/formats/, MIT licence,
author st412m), used unchanged: text.docx, text.xlsx, text.pdf,
refused-scan.pdf, mail-mixed.eml, refused-image.png, utf8.html. They are
synthetic documents made for format tests; the "password" lines in them are
fake values. These files are test data only and are not part of the npm
package.
